  Description: 'Neither an inch of their skin is left unblemished, nor a corner of
    their mind latent. The Paradigm User nestles themselves into the fabric of the
    universe and tears at their cognition to unleash catastrophic power upon foes
    from afar.



    However, such potent understanding of reality provides insight
    into weaving together the unravelings of damage and destruction. As such the
    Paradigm Caster is also an expert in mending damage and a myriad of other supportive
    effects.

'
